So I hope you are understanding why you need experiment tracking.

00:53:53.540 --> 00:53:59.540
Which you do after evaluation in your application changes so that your scores improve.

00:53:59.540 --> 00:54:05.540
So you have to keep track of them too and for this you use experiment tracking.

